  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Boli mnie",
   "texto": [
    "In **Boli mnie głowa** («My head hurts.»), the body part is the subject and **mnie** means «me».",
    "A possessive such as «mi»: **Boli mnie głowa**, not **Moja głowa boli**, is not used."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "singular and plural",
   "texto": [
    "**Boli** goes with a body part in singular: **Boli mnie ząb**.",
    "**Bolą** goes with a plural name: **Bolą mnie plecy**; in Polish, «back» is expressed with a plural word."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Symptoms and gender",
   "texto": [
    "For some symptoms **mam** + object is used: **Mam gorączkę**, «I have a fever.».",
    "**Jestem chory** says so by a man and **Jestem chora**, a woman."
